<deviceset name="IMX296" prefix="IC">
<description>&lt;b&gt;IMX290LQR-C CMOS Solid-state Image Sensor with Square Pixel for Color Cameras &lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package/Case:	LGA-138&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface: MIPI (2-lanes) ans I2C&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Imagen Resolution: 1440x1080&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ADC Converter: 10bit&lt;/li&gt;</description>
